        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a trip into orbit and discover what life is really like aboard the International Space Station. This Emmy-nominated VR experience puts you at the heart of life in zero gravity. Learn to maneuver through weightlessness, dock a visiting spacecraft, and step outside the station on a breathtaking spacewalk. Real NASA astronauts guide your journey with authentic footage and insights from their time in space. (Gamepad not supported.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train like an astronaut</strong>: Complete zero gravity exercises and monitor your progress on your Virtual Tablet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the ISS inside and out</strong>: Navigate the station just like its crew and experience its interior recreated with striking accuracy and immersive detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the void</strong>: Venture outside for a solo spacewalk and drift freely through the quiet, awe-inspiring expanse of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad not supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:missionisshelp@magnopus.com\">missionisshelp@magnopus.com</a></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a trip into orbit and discover what life is really like aboard the International Space Station. This Emmy-nominated VR experience puts you at the heart of life in zero gravity. Learn to maneuver through weightlessness, dock a visiting spacecraft, and step outside the station on a breathtaking spacewalk. Real NASA astronauts guide your journey with authentic footage and insights from their time in space. (Gamepad not supported.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train like an astronaut</strong>: Complete zero gravity exercises and monitor your progress on your Virtual Tablet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the ISS inside and out</strong>: Navigate the station just like its crew and experience its interior recreated with striking accuracy and immersive detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the void</strong>: Venture outside for a solo spacewalk and drift freely through the quiet, awe-inspiring expanse of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad not supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:missionisshelp@magnopus.com\">missionisshelp@magnopus.com</a></p>",
